%% Sequence Diagram for Youth Account Management APIs
sequenceDiagram
    participant Parent as Parent/Guardian
    participant UI as Parent Portal UI (React SPA)
    participant API as Youth Account API (Spring Boot REST API)
    participant DB as Youth Account DB (PostgreSQL)
    participant AccountService as Account Service
    participant TransactionService as Transaction Service
    participant PaymentService as Payment Service

    %% Dashboard API
    Parent->>UI: Login & request dashboard (OAuth2)
    UI->>API: GET /api/youth-accounts/{youthAccountId}/dashboard
    API->>AccountService: Retrieve account details
    API->>TransactionService: Retrieve recent transactions
    API->>DB: Fetch spending limit
    API-->>UI: Dashboard data (balance, limit, recent transactions)
    UI-->>Parent: Display dashboard

    %% Fund Transfer API
    Parent->>UI: Initiate fund transfer
    UI->>API: POST /api/youth-accounts/{youthAccountId}/fund-transfer
    API->>AccountService: Validate source account
    API->>PaymentService: Initiate transfer
    API->>DB: Update youth account balance
    API-->>UI: Transfer result
    UI-->>Parent: Show transfer status

    %% Spending Limit Configuration API
    Parent->>UI: Set weekly spending limit
    UI->>API: PUT /api/youth-accounts/{youthAccountId}/spending-limit
    API->>DB: Update spending limit
    API-->>UI: Limit update confirmation
    UI-->>Parent: Show confirmation

    %% Transaction History API
    Parent->>UI: View transaction history
    UI->>API: GET /api/youth-accounts/{youthAccountId}/transactions
    API->>TransactionService: Fetch transactions
    API-->>UI: Transaction list with pagination
    UI-->>Parent: Display transactions